WEBVTT

00:01:58.624 --> 00:02:01.204
And basically, the next day,
Trump tweeted this:

00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:03.696
[Happy New Year to all,
including to my many enemies

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.874
and those who have fought me
and lost so badly

00:02:05.898 --> 00:02:07.769
they just don't know what to do. Love!]

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:08.975
(Laughter)

00:02:08.999 --> 00:02:10.443
It's the same!

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:13.047
(Applause)

00:02:13.071 --> 00:02:15.535
This is the era of strongmen.

00:02:15.559 --> 00:02:20.935
And soon, Donald Trump was able to meet
his personal hero, Vladimir Putin,

00:02:20.959 --> 00:02:23.755
and this is how the first meeting went:

00:02:23.779 --> 00:02:26.474
[I'll help you find the hackers.
Give me your password.]

00:02:26.498 --> 00:02:29.244
(Laughter)

00:02:29.268 --> 00:02:31.679
And I'm not inventing anything.